# corpus/partial-construction
profile own
summary fail borrow direct
failure stop typed Stop
scope.begin argument
new a A
call.enter later_argument fail
call.exit later_argument - stop
scope.unwind argument stop
catch Stop first
check A
reset.log
scope.begin array_scope
new b B
call.enter later_element fail
call.exit later_element - stop
scope.unwind array_scope stop
catch Stop second
check B
reset.log
scope.begin map_scope
new c C
call.enter later_value fail
call.exit later_value - stop
scope.unwind map_scope stop
catch Stop third
check C
reset.log
scope.begin constructor_caller
call.enter constructor fail
new i I
stage constructor item i
call.exit constructor - stop
scope.unwind constructor_caller stop
catch Stop fourth
check I
